{"chapter_id":"main-quest-20603","main_id":20603,"main_title":"时不再来","main_description":"蒙德城的危机解除了，但塞琉斯先生似乎有些…遗憾…","chapter_title":"时不再来","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2060305,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2060305,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":206030504,"next_line_ids":[206030505],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1409,"speaker_text_hash":1677307221,"speaker":"塞琉斯","speaker_raw":"塞琉斯","text_hash":3914076130,"text":"奇怪，先前来攻击蒙德城的大部队都已经被击退了，为什么它们还在蒙德城附近游荡？","raw_text":"奇怪，先前来攻击蒙德城的大部队都已经被击退了，为什么它们还在蒙德城附近游荡？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2060305.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-20603","main_id":20603,"main_title":"时不再来","main_description":"蒙德城的危机解除了，但塞琉斯先生似乎有些…遗憾…","chapter_title":"时不再来","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2060305,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2060305,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":206030505,"next_line_ids":[206030506],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1409,"speaker_text_hash":1677307221,"speaker":"塞琉斯","speaker_raw":"塞琉斯","text_hash":1909758786,"text":"难道它们还有什么计划…不行，我得把冒险家们都召集回来，重新发布委托，不能对这些魔物掉以轻心。","raw_text":"难道它们还有什么计划…不行，我得把冒险家们都召集回来，重新发布委托，不能对这些魔物掉以轻心。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2060305.json"}
